---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";

const repo = "https://github.com/abuhurera00/boltie";

const chores = [
  "open my-app in vs code",
  "start a postgres container for local dev",
  "what's running on port 3000?",
];
---

<Base title="Boltie - say it, Boltie does it" description="A tiny open-source robot that walks along your taskbar and does your computer chores. Asks before anything risky.">
  <main>
    <header>
      <img src="/favicon.svg" alt="" width="56" height="56" />
      <h1>Boltie</h1>
      <p class="lead">A tiny robot that lives on your taskbar and does the boring computer stuff for you.</p>
      <p class="actions">
        <a class="button" href={`${repo}/releases/latest`}>Download</a>
        <a href={repo}>Source on GitHub</a>
      </p>
    </header>

    <section>
      <h2>Things you can tell it</h2>
      <ul class="chores">
        {chores.map((c) => <li><code>"{c}"</code></li>)}
      </ul>
      <p class="muted">Press <kbd>Ctrl</kbd> + <kbd>Shift</kbd> + <kbd>Space</kbd> or click the robot, type, done.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="grid">
      <div>
        <h3>Asks before it touches anything</h3>
        <p>Looking things up happens straight away. Anything that changes your machine shows you the exact command first. Some commands it simply won't run.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Uses the Claude you already have</h3>
        <p>Paste an Anthropic API key, or let it use your Claude Code login. Nothing to download beyond the app.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Skills are just markdown</h3>
        <p>Write down a routine like "start my dev setup" as a few steps in a <code>.md</code> file and Boltie follows it.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Small and open</h3>
        <p>Built with Rust and Tauri, MIT licensed. Windows first, macOS and Linux next.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Build it yourself</h2>
      <pre><code>git clone {repo}
cd boltie
pnpm install
pnpm dev</code></pre>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p class="muted">MIT licensed. Not affiliated with Anthropic.</p>
  </footer>
</Base>

<style>
  main,
  footer {
    max-width: 860px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 16px;
  }
  header {
    padding: 72px 0 40px;
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 48px;
    margin: 12px 0 4px;
  }
  .lead {
    font-size: 21px;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 20px;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 28px;
  }
  .button {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: #1b2130;
    padding: 10px 20px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  section {
    padding: 28px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .chores {
    padding-left: 18px;
  }
  .chores li {
    margin: 6px 0;
  }
  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
    gap: 8px 32px;
  }
  .grid h3 {
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  .grid p {
    margin-top: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  pre {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  kbd {
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 0 5px;
    font-size: 0.85em;
  }
  .muted {
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  footer {
    padding-bottom: 40px;
  }
</style>
